---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Settings" description="What Video production does and does not do." page="settings">
  <ul class="plain-list">
    <li>Briefs, storyboards, shots and visual references are records in your organization's Onto. The app adds their types there once and never changes them.</li>
    <li>Agents save storyboards through StoryboardChanges, which stages an Onto change batch. Nothing is saved until a member reviews it in Onto.</li>
    <li>It does not generate video or images yet.</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
